{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 09:17-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.LOAN.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["pt"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["Por favor, utilize a tecla backspace para apagar."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["As teclas de seta para a esquerda, para cima e para baixo est\u00e3o desativadas. Assim como as teclas home, end, pgup e pgdn."],"Use backspace to delete.":["Utilizar o backspace para apagar."],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Se o valor for seleccionado, basta come\u00e7ar a escrever um novo valor para limpar o valor anterior."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["Quando um n\u00famero \u00e9 seleccionado (valor mostrado em inverso), usar a tecla de seta para a direita para limpar a selec\u00e7\u00e3o sem limpar o valor. Em seguida, retroceder para editar."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["DICA: Geralmente \u00e9 melhor usar as teclas TAB ou SHIFT-TAB para passar de uma entrada para a seguinte ou para a entrada anterior."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["DICA 2: Geralmente, a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de um valor \u00e9 ineficiente. Uma vez que os valores s\u00e3o seleccionados automaticamente, basta digitar o n\u00famero que deseja."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["N\u00e3o digite o car\u00e1cter separador de milhar."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Se usar a conven\u00e7\u00e3o dos EUA, isso seria a v\u00edrgula.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["Sou suficientemente esperto para inseri-los por si!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["Ocorreu um erro de c\u00e1lculo de data desconhecido."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["Por favor, forne\u00e7a-nos os seus dados e configura\u00e7\u00f5es para que possamos corrigir isto. Obrigado."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["A data n\u00e3o \u00e9 v\u00e1lida - ano incorreto."],"Jan":["jan"],"Feb":["Fev"],"Mar":["Mar"],"Apr":["Abr"],"May":["Maio"],"Jun":["Jun"],"Jul":["Jul"],"Aug":["Ago"],"Sept":["Set"],"Oct":["Out"],"Nov":["Nov"],"Dec":["Dez"],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Erro: datas fora de sequ\u00eancia."],"Exception":["Exce\u00e7\u00e3o"],"occurred when accessing":["ocorreu ao aceder"],"Invalid index":["\u00cdndice inv\u00e1lido"],"Unknown":["Desconhecido"],"u":["u"],"U":["U"],"Internal limit reached. Balance exceeds +\/- 99 trillion.":["Limite interno atingido. O saldo excede +\/- 99 trili\u00f5es."],"YTD":["YTD"],"Running Totals":["Totais acumulados"],"Normal":["Normal"],"Your Personalized Loan Schedule":["O seu cronograma de empr\u00e9stimo personalizado"],"Last payment amount decreased by":["O montante do \u00faltimo pagamento diminuiu em"],"due to rounding":["devido ao arredondamento"],"Last payment amount increased by":["O valor do \u00faltimo pagamento aumentou em"],"Loan Summary":["Resumo do empr\u00e9stimo"],"Loan Amount":["Valor do empr\u00e9stimo"],"Number of Payments":["N\u00famero de pagamentos"],"Annual Interest Rate":["Taxa anual de juro"],"Periodic Payment":["Presta\u00e7\u00e3o peri\u00f3dica"],"Loan Date":["Data do empr\u00e9stimo"],"1st Payment Due":["1\u00aa Presta\u00e7\u00e3o devida"],"Payment Frequency":["Frequ\u00eancia de presta\u00e7\u00f5es"],"Last Payment Due":["\u00daltima presta\u00e7\u00e3o devida"],"Total Interest Due":["Juros totais devidos"],"Total All Payments":["Total de todas as presta\u00e7\u00f5es"],"Payment Schedule":["Tabela de pagamentos"],"Year":["Ano"],"Date":["Data"],"Payment":["Presta\u00e7\u00e3o"],"Interest":["Juros"],"Principal":["Capital"],"Balance":["Saldo"],"Calculation method: Normal":["M\u00e9todo de c\u00e1lculo: Normal"],"Total Principal":["Capital Total"],"Total Interest":["Juros totais"],"Pct. of Total Payments":["% de Pagamentos Totais"],"Annual Principal and Interest Totals":["Totais Anuais de Capital e Juros"],"Accumulated Principal and Interest with Remaining Balance":["Capital Acumulado e Juros com Saldo Remanescente"],"Total Principal and Interest":["Total do Capital e Juros"],"Loan":["Empr\u00e9stimo"],"There are too many unknown values.":["H\u00e1 demasiados valores desconhecidos."],"Enter \"Loan Amount\", \"Number of Payments\" and \"Annual Interest Rate\".":["Introduza \"Valor do empr\u00e9stimo\", \"N\u00famero de pagamentos\" e \"Taxa de juro anual\"."],"<strong>Loan Calculator Help...<\/strong>":["<strong>Ajuda da calculadora de empr\u00e9stimo...<\/strong>"],"<p>Using the calculator is straightforward. User enters a &quot;loan amount&quot;, &quot;number of months&quot;, &quot;annual interest rate&quot;. The calculator calculates the monthly payment amount.<\/p>":["<p>Usar o calculador \u00e9 simples. O utilizador insere o &quot;valor do empr\u00e9stimo&quot;, &quot;n\u00famero de meses&quot;, &quot;taxa de juro anual&quot;. O calculador calcula o montante do pagamento mensal.<\/p>"],"<p>The &quot;Payment Method&quot; determines when the first payment is due. With the default selection, &quot;End-of-Period&quot;, the first payment will be due one month after the loan is made. If &quot;Start-of-Period&quot; is selected, then the first payment will be due on the loan date.<\/p>":["<p>O &quot;momento do pagamento&quot; determina quando o primeiro pagamento \u00e9 devido. Com a sele\u00e7\u00e3o padr\u00e3o, &quot;Fim do Per\u00edodo&quot;, o primeiro pagamento ser\u00e1 devido um m\u00eas ap\u00f3s a concess\u00e3o do empr\u00e9stimo. Se &quot;In\u00edcio do Per\u00edodo&quot; for selecionado, o primeiro pagamento ser\u00e1 devido na data do empr\u00e9stimo.<\/p>"],"<p class=\"tail\">The term (duration) of the loan is expressed as a number of months.<\/p>":["<p class=\"tail\">O prazo (dura\u00e7\u00e3o) do empr\u00e9stimo \u00e9 expresso em n\u00famero de meses.<\/p>"],"<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 months = &nbsp;5 years<\/li><li>120 months = 10 years<\/li><li>180 months = 15 years<\/li><li>240 months = 20 years<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 months = 30 years<\/li><\/ul>":["<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 meses = &nbsp;5 anos<\/li><li>120 meses = 10 anos<\/li><li>180 meses = 15 anos<\/li><li>240 meses = 20 anos<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 meses = 30 anos<\/li><\/ul>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Set the dates? Set or change the payment and compounding frequencies? Print the schedule? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Precisa de mais op\u00e7\u00f5es, incluindo a capacidade de resolver outras inc\u00f3gnitas? Definir as datas? Definir ou alterar as frequ\u00eancias de pagamento e capitaliza\u00e7\u00e3o? Imprimir o cronograma? Exportar para ficheiros MS Word&trade; (.docx) ou MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx)? Por favor, visite: <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["As datas devem ser o primeiro dia do m\u00eas."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Um objeto de data JavaScript inv\u00e1lido."],"Monthly":["Mensal"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Set the dates? Set or change the payment and compounding frequencies? Print the charts? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Precisa de mais op\u00e7\u00f5es, incluindo a capacidade de resolver outras inc\u00f3gnitas? Definir as datas? Definir ou alterar as frequ\u00eancias de pagamento e capitaliza\u00e7\u00e3o? Imprimir os gr\u00e1ficos? Exportar para ficheiros MS Word&trade; (.docx) ou MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx)? Por favor, visite: <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Prepared for":["Preparado para"],"Address":["Endere\u00e7o"],"City, State  ZIP":["Cidade, Estado, C\u00f3digo Postal"],"Prepared On":["Preparado em"],"Prepared by":["Preparado por"],"Phone":["Telefone"],"Email":["E-mail"],"Website":["Website"]}}}